>SC Sen</b>Andrews<!-- --> <i class="d">D +1.3</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/ks/governor"><b>KS Gov</b>Holscher<!-- --> <i class="d">D +1.4</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/ak/senate"><b>AK Sen</b>Peltola<!-- --> <i class="d">D +1.4</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/ne/governor"><b>NE Gov</b>Pillen<!-- --> <i class="r">R +1.5</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/me/senate"><b>ME Sen</b>Jackson<!-- --> <i class="d">D +2.0</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/tx/senate"><b>TX Sen</b>Talarico<!-- --> <i class="d">D +2.1</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/tx/governor"><b>TX Gov</b>Abbott<!-- --> <i class="r">R +2.2</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/wi/governor"><b>WI Gov</b>Crowley<!-- --> <i class="d">D +2.8</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/oh/senate"><b>OH Sen</b>Brown<!-- --> <i class="d">D +2.8</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/ne/senate"><b>NE Sen</b>Osborn<!-- --> <i class="i">I +3.0</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/mi/senate"><b>MI Sen</b>El-Sayed<!-- --> <i class="d">D +3.0</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/nv/governor"><b>NV Gov</b>Ford<!-- --> <i class="d">D +3.5</i></a></span><span><a tabindex="-1" href="/forecast/fl/governor"><b>FL Gov</b>Donalds<!-- --> <i class="r">R +4.3</i></a></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><main class="opp-main"><div class="opp-page"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://onpointpolitics.us/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Forecast","item":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast"}]},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast#page","url":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast","name":"2026 midterm election forecast","description":"The On Point Politics 2026 midterm forecast: chance of Democratic control of the Senate 79%, of the House 91%, with an average of 53 Democratic Senate seats and 243 Democratic House seats across 2,000 simulations.","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/#website"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-US","dateModified":"2026-10-21T08:00:00-04:00","mainEntity":{"@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast#dataset"}},{"@type":"Dataset","@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast#dataset","name":"2026 midterm election forecast","description":"The On Point Politics 2026 midterm forecast: chance of Democratic control of the Senate 79%, of the House 91%, with an average of 53 Democratic Senate seats and 243 Democratic House seats across 2,000 simulations.","url":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast","creator":{"@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/#organization"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://onpointpolitics.us/#organization"},"dateModified":"2026-10-21T08:00:00-04:00","isAccessibleForFree":true,"inLanguage":"en-US","license":"https://onpointpolitics.us/terms","temporalCoverage":"2025-01-01/2026-11-03","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","name":"United States"},"keywords":["2026 midterms","Senate forecast","House forecast","governor forecast","election model"],"variableMeasured":["Chance of Senate control","Chance of House control","Race win probability","Projected vote margin"],"measurementTechnique":"Polling average and Monte Carlo election simulation","distribution":[{"@type":"DataDownload","encodingFormat":"application/json","contentUrl":"https://onpointpolitics.us/forecast/model.json"}]}]}</script><div class="opp fc-page hub-wrap"><section class="hub fc-wide" aria-labelledby="hub-h"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Forecast</span></nav><nav class="fnav" aria-label="Forecast sections"><a class="on" aria-current="page" href="/forecast">Overview</a><a href="/forecast?office=senate#desk">Senate</a><a href="/forecast?office=house#desk">House</a><a href="/forecast?office=governor#desk">Governors</a><a href="/forecast/swingometer">Swingometer</a><a href="/forecast/statewide">Statewide offices</a><a href="/forecast/legislatures">State legislatures</a><a href="/forecast/measures">Ballot measures</a><a href="/forecast/other">Every other race</a><a href="/forecast/methodology">Methodology</a></nav><div class="hub-top"><div class="card hub-stagecard"><div class="hub-loading"><span></span>Drawing every seat on the ballot</div></div><aside class="hub-side"><header class="hub-hero"><div class="eye g">2026 forecast</div><h1 id="hub-h">Every race on the ballot. <em>One board.</em></h1><p class="lede">The Senate, the House, <!-- -->36<!-- --> governors, <!-- -->114<!-- --> statewide offices and <!-- -->87<!-- --> state legislative chambers, forecast on one national environment, plus <!-- -->145<!-- --> statewide ballot measures. Each dot is one seat on the 2026 ballot, colored by who is favored. Hover for the odds, click for the race.</p><div class="hub-ribbon"><span><b class="mono">6,700</b>seats</span><span><b class="mono">2,000</b>simulations</span></div><a class="hub-swing" href="/forecast/swingometer"><span class="eye g">New</span><b>Swingometer</b><span>Move any group of voters and watch every race and chamber move with them</span></a></header></aside></div></section></div><div class="opp fc-page"><style>
/* ── desk tokens, mapped onto the On Point Politics brand tokens ──────────────
   The desk keeps its own --fc-* names so the rules below stay readable, but
   every one resolves to a brand token from app/globals.css, in both themes. */
.fc-page {
  --fc-bg: var(--bg);
  --fc-bg-rgb: var(--canvas-rgb);
  --fc-ink: var(--ink);
  --fc-ink-rgb: var(--ink-rgb);
  --fc-line-rgb: var(--line-rgb);
  --fc-band: var(--glass);
  --fc-idle: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06);
  --fc-idle-line: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),.6);
  --fc-elev: rgba(var(--bg2-rgb),.94);
  --fc-elev-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  --fc-dem: var(--dem2); --fc-dem-rgb: 61,123,255;
  --fc-gop: var(--gop2); --fc-gop-rgb: 255,59,92;
  --fc-accent: var(--ink);
  --fc-gold: var(--ink2); --fc-gold-rgb: 201,194,214;
  /* light theme: the rgb triples above follow the page tokens */
  --fc-line: var(--line);
  --fc-ink-2: var(--ink2);
  --fc-mute: 1; --fc-floor: 0.13; --fc-struct: 1.25;
  position: relative; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--font-b); font-size: 15px;
}
:root[data-theme="light"] .fc-page, :root[data-theme="light"] .fc-tip { --fc-floor: 0.3; --fc-gold-rgb: 70,61,90; --fc-dem-rgb: 42,99,240; --fc-gop-rgb: 232,38,75; }
.fc-page .ph h1 .fc-hp.d { color: var(--dem2); }
.fc-page .ph h1 .fc-hp.r { color: var(--gop2); }
.fc-page .pmeta b.d { color: var(--dem2); }
.fc-page .pmeta b.r { color: var(--gop2); }
.fc-page .pmeta .btn { text-decoration: none; }
.fc-stack { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.fc-card { min-width: 0; }
.fc-card .card-h h3 { font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
.fc-page .seg.fc-segc { flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-page .seg.sm button { padding: 5px 11px; font-size: 11.5px; }
.fc-page .seg button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 2px; }
.fc-body { margin: 0; max-width: 70ch; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink2); }
.fc-foot { margin: 22px 0 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mute); }
.fc-foot a { color: var(--ink2); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
.fc-foot a:hover { color: var(--hi); }

.fc-seatbar { margin: 0 0 4px; }
.fc-seatbar-ends { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-seatbar-ends b { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-seatbar-mid { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.fc-seatbar-track { position: relative; height: 12px; margin-top: 8px; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--gop); }
.fc-seatbar-fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; background: var(--dem); }
.fc-seatbar-tick { position: absolute; top: -2px; bottom: -2px; width: 2px; background: var(--hi); opacity: .9; }
.fc-seatbar-note { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); }

.fc-controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; scroll-margin-top: 90px; }
.fc-controls .seg { margin-left: 0; }
/* the statewide office picker holds 15 offices: let it wrap onto a second row so every office stays reachable */
.fc-dbtabs .seg.fc-segc { flex-wrap: wrap; flex-shrink: 1; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; row-gap: 4px; border-radius: 18px; }
.fc-dbtabs .seg.fc-segc button { white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-ctl-label { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.fc-ctl-label + .seg + .fc-ctl-label { margin-left: 10px; }
.fc-mapcard { scroll-margin-top: 90px; }
.fc-mapwrap { position: relative; margin-top: 16px; }
.fc-map { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 1180px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; overflow: visible; }
.fc-map.race { width: min(760px, 100%); }
.fc-map-idle { fill: var(--fc-idle); stroke: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.06 * var(--fc-struct))); stroke-width: 0.8; }
.fc-map-race { stroke: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),0.7); stroke-width: 0.7; cursor: pointer; transition: filter .15s ease; }
.fc-map-race.cd { stroke: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),0.55); stroke-width: 0.45; }
.fc-map-race:hover { filter: brightness(1.25); stroke: var(--hi); }
.fc-map-stateline { fill: none; stroke: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.3 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); stroke-width: 0.9; pointer-events: none; }
.fc-map-halo { fill: none; stroke: var(--fc-ink); stroke-width: 1.6; pointer-events: none; }
.fc-map-loading { min-height: 320px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.fc-map.anim { animation: fcMapIn 420ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
@keyframes fcMapIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
.fc-hex { stroke: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),0.7); stroke-width: 1; cursor: pointer; transition: filter .15s ease; animation: fcHexIn 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both; }
.fc-hexg { animation: fcHexIn 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both; }
.fc-hexg .fc-hex { animation: none; }
.fc-hex:hover { filter: brightness(1.25); }
.fc-hex.idle { fill: var(--fc-idle); stroke: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.07 * var(--fc-struct))); cursor: default; }
.fc-hex.idle:hover { filter: none; }
.fc-hex-label { fill: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.9 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-anchor: middle; pointer-events: none; paint-order: stroke; stroke: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),0.55); stroke-width: 2.5px; }
.fc-hex-label.idle { fill: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.22 * var(--fc-struct))); stroke: none; }
@keyframes fcHexIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.6); transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; } to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; } }

.fc-legend { justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-top: 14px; }
.fc-legend .mono { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink2); }
.fc-ramp { flex: 1; max-width: 300px; margin: 0 !important; }
.fc-legend-note { width: 100%; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
/* The tips are portaled to document.body, outside .fc-page, so they carry their own tokens.
   Before, every --fc-* token was undefined there and the card rendered see-through over the map. */
.fc-tip { --fc-ink-rgb: var(--ink-rgb); --fc-line-rgb: var(--line-rgb); --fc-mute: 1; --fc-floor: 0.13; --fc-struct: 1.25;
  --fc-dem: var(--dem2); --fc-gop: var(--gop2);
  position: fixed; z-index: 80; font-family: var(--font-b); color: var(--ink2); width: 274px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; pointer-events: none;
  background: rgba(var(--bg2-rgb),.98); border: 1px solid var(--line2);
  box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),.45), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06); }
:root[data-theme="light"] .fc-tip { --fc-ink-rgb: 17,0,25; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(17,0,25,.14); }
.fc-tip-name { font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--hi); }
.fc-tip-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; }
.fc-tip-row i { width: 3px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-tip-row b { font-weight: 700; }
.fc-tip-row span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-tip-row em { font-style: normal; margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip-foot { margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip.wide { width: 304px; }
.fc-tip-sub { margin-top: 3px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip-vote { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 7px; font-size: 13px; }
.fc-tip-vote i { width: 3px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-tip-vote b { font-weight: 600; flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-tip-vote span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-tip-vote em { font-style: normal; width: 48px; text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip-vote.total { margin-top: 9px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); }
.fc-tip-vote.total b { color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fc-unit { cursor: pointer; transition: filter .15s ease; }
.fc-unit:hover { filter: brightness(1.3); }
.fc-stage-layer { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 14px; }
.fc-stage-layer button { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.42 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.09); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 16px; cursor: pointer; }
.fc-stage-layer button:hover { color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.75 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-stage-layer button.on { color: var(--fc-ink); background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.1); border-color: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.22); }
.fc-stage-votes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 8px 22px; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
.fc-stage-votes span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.58 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-stage-votes i { width: 3px; height: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-stage-votes b { color: var(--fc-ink); font-family: var(--font-m); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-stage-votes em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-stage-votes.rcv { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; gap: 6px 18px; }
.fc-stage-votes.rcv > span:first-child { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.36 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }

.fc-stage-head { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
.fc-stage-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.fc-stage-title h2 { margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.08; color: var(--hi); }
.fc-stage-banner { margin-top: 10px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fc-stage-map { margin-top: 10px; }
.fc-stage-caption { margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }


.fc-hist { position: relative; margin-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 44px; }
.fc-hist-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.fc-hist-bar { transition: opacity .15s ease; }
.fc-hist:hover .fc-hist-bar { opacity: 0.92; }
.fc-hist-anno { position: absolute; top: -6px; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; pointer-events: none; }
.fc-hist-anno.gop { left: 0; }
.fc-hist-anno.dem { right: 0; text-align: right; }
.fc-hist-anno b { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 52px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-hist-anno span { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.85 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-hist-anno em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-hist-rulelabel { position: absolute; top: -2px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-hist-axis { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 36px; height: 0; }
.fc-hist-axis span { position: absolute; top: -22px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-hist-bracket { position: absolute; bottom: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-hist-svglabel { fill: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.85 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fc-hist-svglabel.side { font-size: 11.5px; }

.fc-chartwrap { position: relative; margin-top: 20px; padding-right: 96px; }
.fc-chart { display: block; width: 100%; }
.fc-chart-ends { position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 90px; pointer-events: none; }
.fc-chart-ends span { position: absolute; left: 8px; transform: translateY(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-chart-x { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px; padding-right: 96px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-chart-tag { position: absolute; left: 4px; transform: translateY(-135%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); pointer-events: none; }
.fc-xhair { position: absolute; top: 10px; z-index: 3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.12); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--fc-elev); pointer-events: none; }
.fc-xhair em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xhair span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }

.fc-table-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; }
.fc-table-tools .seg { margin-left: 0; }
.opp input.search.fc-find { flex: 1; min-width: 240px; max-width: 440px; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 14px; }

.fc-table { margin-top: 14px; }
.fc-tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.1fr) minmax(0, 1.7fr) 74px minmax(90px, 1fr) 84px 100px 76px; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  width: 100%; text-align: left; padding: 14px 10px; background: none; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s ease; font-family: inherit; color: inherit; }
.fc-tr:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); }
.fc-tr:not(.fc-th):hover { background: var(--glass2); }
.fc-tr:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: -2px; }
.fc-td-name a { color: var(--hi); }
.fc-td-name a:hover b { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
.fc-th { cursor: default; border-top: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; }
.fc-th span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-th .num { text-align: right; }
.fc-td-name b { display: block; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; }
.fc-td-name em { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-td-cands { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.8 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-td-cands i { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 15px; height: 15px; margin-right: 7px; border-radius: 4px; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-td-cands i.d { background: rgba(var(--fc-dem-rgb),0.16); color: var(--fc-dem); }
.fc-td-cands i.r { background: rgba(var(--fc-gop-rgb),0.16); color: var(--fc-gop); }
/* Independents take the same chip, in the independent purple. Osborn, Bengs, Achilles
   and Bodnar sit in the build's Democratic slot and were reading as Democrats. */
.fc-td-cands i.i { background: rgba(183,140,255,0.14); color: var(--ind); }
.fc-td-margin, .fc-td-prob { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-rating { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.16); white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-rating u { text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.6; }

.fc-mbar { position: relative; display: block; height: 14px; }
.fc-mbar-track { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 5px; height: 4px; border-radius: 99px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg,#10288c 0%,#3d7bff 25%,#d6e2ff 48%,#ffdce4 52%,#ff3b5c 75%,#8c0a28 100%); opacity: 0.5; }
.fc-mbar-band { position: absolute; top: 4px; height: 6px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.26 * var(--fc-struct))); }
.fc-mbar-dot { position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--fc-ink); transform: translate(-50%, -50%); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--fc-bg); }
.fc-mbar-mid { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 1px; bottom: 1px; width: 1px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }


.fc-page .fc-more { display: flex; margin: 16px auto 0; }
.fc-odds { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 64px); align-items: center; }
.fc-score { padding-top: 6px; }
.fc-score-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; padding: 14px 0; }
.fc-score-row + .fc-score-row { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); }
.fc-score-id { min-width: 0; }
.fc-score-id b { display: block; font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 24px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
.fc-score-id em { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-score-p { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(34px, 3.6vw, 46px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-h2h { position: relative; height: 8px; margin-top: 16px; border-radius: 99px; background: #ff3b5c; overflow: visible; }
.fc-h2h i { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: 99px 0 0 99px; background: #3d7bff; }
.fc-h2h-notch { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -3px; bottom: -3px; width: 2px; background: var(--fc-bg); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-h2h-x { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 9px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.fc-odds-dial { max-width: 470px; }

/* the projected ballot */
.fc-ballot { margin-top: clamp(30px, 4vh, 44px); }
.fc-ballot-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-ballot-bar { display: flex; height: 10px; margin-top: 16px; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.1 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-ballot-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; }
.fc-ballot-bar i + i { box-shadow: inset 1px 0 0 var(--fc-bg); }
.fc-ballot-list { margin-top: 6px; }
.fc-ballot-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px minmax(0,1fr) auto; grid-template-areas: "dot id num" ". track track"; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 12px; padding: 13px 0; }
.fc-ballot-row + .fc-ballot-row { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); }
.fc-ballot-row > i { grid-area: dot; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; align-self: center; }
.fc-ballot-id { grid-area: id; min-width: 0; }
.fc-ballot-id b { display: block; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.5vw, 18px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.fc-ballot-id em { display: block; margin-top: 3px; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-ballot-num { grid-area: num; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }
.fc-ballot-num b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(19px, 2vw, 24px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-ballot-num em { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-ballot-track { grid-area: track; height: 4px; margin-top: 6px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.08 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); overflow: hidden; }
.fc-ballot-track i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; }
@media (max-width: 520px) {
  .fc-ballot-row { gap: 4px 10px; }
  .fc-ballot-num b { font-size: 18px; }
}

/* the outcome distribution */
.fc-outcome { margin-top: clamp(36px, 5vh, 56px); }
.fc-uncontested-note { margin: clamp(36px, 5vh, 56px) 0 0; padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid var(--fc-line); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.03 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fc-ink-2); max-width: 70ch; }
.fc-outcome-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-outcome-chart { position: relative; margin-top: 18px; }
.fc-outcome-chart .fc-chart { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.fc-outcome-median { position: absolute; top: 0; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
.fc-outcome-tick { position: absolute; bottom: 34px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.fc-outcome-axis { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 6px; height: 0; }
.fc-outcome-axis span { position: absolute; transform: translateX(-50%); font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; opacity: 0.75; }
.fc-outcome-note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.5 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-outcome-note b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; }

/* what carries the estimate */
.fc-grade { font-style: normal; margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line2); background: var(--glass2); vertical-align: 2px; }

/* the environment chips */
.fc-envchips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
.fc-envchips span { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 7px; padding: 8px 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.1); border-radius: 9px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-envchips b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-envchips b.hl { color: var(--ink); }

/* the estimate waterfall */
.fc-flow { margin-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.1); }
.fc-flow-scalehead { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 0 4px; }
.fc-flow-k { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-flow-k.head { color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-flow-k.final { color: var(--fc-accent); }
.fc-flow-num { font-style: normal; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-flow-carry { font-style: normal; margin-left: 4px; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid var(--line2); color: var(--fc-accent); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
.fc-flow-window { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-flow-window i { width: 44px; height: 1px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.2 * var(--fc-struct))); }
.fc-flow-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 44px); align-items: center; padding: 17px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.06); }
.fc-flow-row.off .fc-flow-k, .fc-flow-row.off .fc-flow-cap { opacity: 0.32; }
.fc-flow-row.final { border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.14); background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),0.025); }
.fc-flow-cap { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-flow-cap b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-flow-chips { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: middle; }
.fc-flow-track { position: relative; height: 40px; border-left: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.12); border-right: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.12); }
.fc-flow-track::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 50%; height: 1px; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); }
.fc-flow-even { position: absolute; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 1px; background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.22 * var(--fc-struct))); }
.fc-flow-even::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0 3px, var(--fc-bg) 3px 6px); }
.fc-flow-link { position: absolute; top: 50%; height: 2px; transform: translateY(-50%); background: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.3 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); border-radius: 2px; }
.fc-flow-ghost { position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 7px; height: 7px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 99px; border: 1.4px solid rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); background: var(--fc-bg); }
.fc-flow-dot { position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 11px; height: 11px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 99px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--fc-bg); }
.fc-flow-dot.final { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
.fc-flow-val { position: absolute; top: 50%; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-flow-val em { font-style: normal; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
.fc-flow-val.final { font-size: 14px; }
.fc-flow-val.final em { font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }


.fc-polls { margin-top: 22px; }
.fc-polls-h { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.38 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-poll { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 11px 4px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.07); font-size: 13.5px; }
.fc-poll b { font-weight: 600; min-width: 180px; }
.fc-kind { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.14); border-radius: 5px; padding: 3px 7px; min-width: 92px; text-align: center; }
.fc-kind.flag { color: var(--fc-gold); border-color: rgba(var(--fc-gold-rgb),0.4); }
.fc-poll > span { color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.45 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); font-size: 12px; flex: 1; }
.fc-poll em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }

/* simulated crosstabs */
.fc-xt-total { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 26px; margin-top: 18px; padding: 16px 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.1); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.025); }
.fc-xt-total .k { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-total .v { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 20px; margin-left: auto; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-total .v b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-left: 5px; }
.fc-xt-total .mg { padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--fc-ink); }
.fc-xt-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; padding: 8px 16px; cursor: pointer;
  background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.1); border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-toggle:hover { color: var(--fc-ink); border-color: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.22); }
.fc-xt-toggle span { letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-grid { columns: 3 310px; column-gap: 16px; margin-top: 18px; }
.fc-xt-tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-top: 20px; }
.fc-xt-tab { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 7px 13px; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.5 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.03);
  border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.09); border-radius: 999px; transition: color .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease; }
.fc-xt-tab:hover { color: var(--fc-ink); border-color: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.24); }
.fc-xt-tab.on { color: var(--fc-bg); background: var(--fc-ink); border-color: var(--fc-ink); }
.fc-xt-tab.alt { letter-spacing: 0.14em; }
.fc-xt-tab em { font-style: normal; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.42 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-tab.on em { color: rgba(var(--fc-bg-rgb),0.45); }
.fc-xt-tab:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 2px; }
.fc-xt-panel { margin-top: 18px; }
.fc-xt-one { padding: 6px 18px 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.02); overflow-x: auto; }
.fc-page .fc-xt-ph { margin: 0 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--hi); }
.fc-xt-pn { margin: 0 0 14px; max-width: 68ch; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.6 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
table.fc-xt.lead-table { padding: 0; }
table.fc-xt.lead-table tr.clickable { cursor: pointer; }
table.fc-xt.lead-table tr.clickable:hover td { background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.04); }
table.fc-xt.lead-table tr.clickable:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: -2px; }
table.fc-xt td.pull { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; }
table.fc-xt.lead-table td.g { width: 26%; min-width: 150px; }
table.fc-xt.lead-table td.sh, table.fc-xt.lead-table th.sh { text-align: left; padding-left: 22px; }
table.fc-xt.lead-table th:nth-child(3), table.fc-xt.lead-table td:nth-child(3) { text-align: right; padding-right: 8%; }
.fc-xt-card { break-inside: avoid; -webkit-column-break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 16px 16px 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.02); min-width: 0; }
.fc-page .fc-xt-card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.75 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
table.fc-xt { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
table.fc-xt th { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.35 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); text-align: right; padding: 0 0 8px 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
table.fc-xt th:first-child { text-align: left; padding-left: 0; }
table.fc-xt td { padding: 7px 0 7px 10px; text-align: right; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.05); color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.7 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); white-space: nowrap; }
table.fc-xt td:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
table.fc-xt td.g { text-align: left; min-width: 116px; white-space: normal; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.85 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-xt-one table.fc-xt td.g, .fc-xt-panel > table.fc-xt td.g { min-width: 210px; }
.fc-xt-one table.fc-xt td, .fc-xt-one table.fc-xt th { padding-left: 18px; }
table.fc-xt td.sh, table.fc-xt th.sh { color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.42 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
table.fc-xt td.lead { font-weight: 700; }
table.fc-xt td.mg i { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; color: var(--fc-ink); }
.fc-xt-bar { display: flex; height: 4px; margin-top: 5px; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.06); }
.fc-xt-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fc-xt-grid { columns: 1; }
  .fc-xt-tab { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .fc-xt-one { padding: 4px 10px 8px; }
  .fc-xt-one table.fc-xt td, .fc-xt-one table.fc-xt th { padding-left: 8px; }
  .fc-xt-one table.fc-xt td.g, .fc-xt-panel > table.fc-xt td.g { min-width: 120px; }
  .fc-xt-card { padding: 14px 12px 8px; }
  table.fc-xt { font-size: 11.5px; }
  table.fc-xt th, table.fc-xt td { padding-left: 6px; }
  table.fc-xt td.g { min-width: 78px; }
  table.fc-xt td.mg i { padding: 2px 5px; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .fc-xt-total .v { margin-left: 0; gap: 8px 14px; }
}

.fc-similar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 18px; }
.fc-simchip { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; background: rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.12); border-radius: 99px; padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer;
  font-family: inherit; color: inherit; transition: border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease; }
.fc-simchip:hover { border-color: var(--line2); background: var(--glass2); }
.fc-simchip b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
.fc-simchip span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; }
.fc-simchip em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }


@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fc-tr { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) 70px minmax(70px, 1fr) 72px; }
  .fc-td-cands, .fc-tr span:nth-child(6), .fc-tr span:nth-child(7) { display: none; }
  .fc-odds { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .fc-hist-anno { position: static; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .fc-flow-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .fc-hist-anno.dem { text-align: left; }
  .fc-hist-anno b { font-size: 30px; }
  .fc-outcome-axis span:nth-child(2), .fc-outcome-axis span:nth-child(4) { display: none; }
  .fc-score-p { font-size: 30px; }
  .fc-xhair { display: none; }
  .fc-chartwrap, .fc-chart-x { padding-right: 58px; }
  .fc-chart-ends { width: 54px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fc-map.anim, .fc-hex, .fc-hexg { animation: none; }
}

/* ── studio floor: black ground, floating maps, motion on arrival ─────────── */
html.fc-black:not([data-theme="light"]), html.fc-black:not([data-theme="light"]) body { background: #000; }
html.fc-black:not([data-theme="light"]) .opp.ambient .orbs { opacity: .22; }
/* the black studio floor is the dark theme only; the light theme keeps its own tokens */
:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .fc-page {
  --bg: #000; --bg2: #08060c; --bg3: #110d18;
  --glass: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.035); --glass2: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06);
  --line: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.09); --line2: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.16);
  --ink: var(--ink); --ink2: var(--ink2); --mute: var(--mute); --mute2: var(--mute2); --hi: #ffffff;
  --gold: #e7b341; --gold2: #bb831c;
  --dem: #3d7bff; --dem2: #7fa6ff; --dem3: #b9ccff;
  --gop: #ff3b5c; --gop2: #ff8399; --gop3: #ffbfcb;
  --ind: #b78cff; --toss: #e7b341; --win: #3ddc97;
  --ink-rgb: 243, 239, 248; --canvas-rgb: 0, 0, 0; --line-rgb: 255, 255, 255; --bg2-rgb: 8, 6, 12; --hi-rgb: 255, 255, 255;
  --shadow-card: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.6), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(var(--line-rgb),.07);
  color-scheme: dark;
}
:root:not([data-theme="light"]) .fc-page .card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(var(--line-rgb),.045), rgba(var(--line-rgb),.012)); border-color: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06); }
.fc-stack > * { animation: fcRise .8s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.fc-stack > *:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .08s; } .fc-stack > *:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .14s; }
.fc-stack > *:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: .2s; } .fc-stack > *:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: .26s; }
@keyframes fcRise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px) scale(.985); } }
/* the map card is not a card any more: the map floats on the floor */
.fc-page .fc-mapcard { background: transparent; border-color: transparent; box-shadow: none; -webkit-backdrop-filter: none; backdrop-filter: none; overflow: visible; }
.fc-mapwrap { padding: 18px 0 30px; isolation: isolate; }
.fc-mapwrap::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 8%; right: 8%; bottom: 2%; height: 70px; z-index: -1; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(131,68,156,.42), transparent); filter: blur(22px); animation: fcFloor 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
.fc-mapwrap::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -6% -4% 0; z-index: -2; pointer-events: none; opacity: .55;
  background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(60% 55% at 50% 50%, #000, transparent); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(60% 55% at 50% 50%, #000, transparent); }
@keyframes fcFloor { from { transform: scaleX(.9); opacity: .6; } to { transform: scaleX(1.05); opacity: 1; } }
.fc-map { filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.9)) drop-shadow(0 0 34px rgba(131,68,156,.22)); }
:root[data-theme="light"] .fc-map { filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 26px rgba(40,18,80,.16)) drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(131,68,156,.12)); }
:root[data-theme="light"] .fc-mapwrap::before { background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(131,68,156,.18), transparent); }
.fc-map.anim { animation: fcBoard .95s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.fc-map.race { animation: fcDeep .75s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
/* the bob runs on the wrapper, a plain composited layer, so the map itself never repaints */
.fc-mapwrap > .fc-map, .fc-stage-map { will-change: transform; }
.fc-stage-map, .fc-mapwrap { animation: fcBob 11s ease-in-out 1s infinite alternate; }
@keyframes fcBoard { 0% { transform: perspective(2400px) translateY(46px) rotateX(12deg) scale(.95); opacity: 0; filter: blur(10px); } 55% { filter: blur(0); } 100% { transform: none; opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes fcDeep { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.05); filter: blur(8px); } }
@keyframes fcBob { from { transform: translateY(-4px); } to { transform: translateY(4px); } }
.fc-map-race, .fc-unit { transition: filter .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
.fc-map-race:hover { filter: brightness(1.3) drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(var(--line-rgb),.35)); }
.fc-seatbar-track { box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(131,68,156,.35); }
.fc-seatbar-fill { animation: fcFill 1.1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; transform-origin: 0 50%; }
@keyframes fcFill { from { transform: scaleX(0); } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fc-stack > *, .fc-map, .fc-map.anim, .fc-map.race, .fc-mapwrap, .fc-stage-map, .fc-mapwrap::before, .fc-seatbar-fill { animation: none !important; }
}

:root { --atl-floor: #000; --atl-shadow: rgba(0,0,0,.85); --atl-shadow2: rgba(0,0,0,.6); }
:root[data-theme="light"] { --atl-floor: #eef0f7; --atl-shadow: rgba(40,18,80,.22); --atl-shadow2: rgba(40,18,80,.12); }

.atl.embedded { margin-top: 0; animation: none; }
.atl.embedded .atl-head p { margin-top: 6px; }
.atl { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 18px; margin-top: 8px; animation: atlBoard .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
@keyframes atlBoard { 0% { transform: perspective(2400px) translateY(46px) rotateX(10deg) scale(.95); opacity: 0; filter: blur(10px); } 55% { filter: blur(0); } 100% { transform: none; opacity: 1; filter: none; } }
.atl-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px 28px; }
.atl-head h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); letter-spacing: -.035em; line-height: 1.02; color: var(--hi); text-wrap: balance; }
.atl-head p { margin: 10px 0 0; max-width: 58ch; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #a9a2b8; }
.atl-grad { background: var(--grad); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; }
.atl-eye { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
.atl-kpi { padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.035); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); animation: atlK .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.atl-kpi b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--hi); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.atl-kpi span { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--mute); }
@keyframes atlK { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px) scale(.97); } }

.atl-rail { display: flex; gap: 10px 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(var(--line-rgb),.045), rgba(var(--line-rgb),.015)); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); }
.atl-group { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.atl-gname { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6884; }
.atl-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.atl-chip { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink2); background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.04); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.09); cursor: pointer; transition: color .2s, background .2s, border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
.atl-chip:hover { color: var(--hi); border-color: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.22); transform: translateY(-1px); }
.atl-chip.on { color: #0a0711; background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); }
.atl-chip.on::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(100deg, transparent 30%, rgba(var(--line-rgb),.75) 50%, transparent 70%); transform: translateX(-120%); animation: atlGlint .9s ease-out; }
@keyframes atlGlint { to { transform: translateX(120%); } }
.atl-chip:focus-visible, .atl-seg button:focus-visible, .atl-tour:focus-visible, .atl-li:focus-visible, .atl-race:focus-visible, .atl-jchips button:focus-visible, .atl-crumbs button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 2px; }

.atl-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px 16px; }
.atl-note { font-size: 13px; color: #a9a2b8; }
.atl-seg { display: inline-flex; padding: 3px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.05); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.09); }
.atl-seg button { padding: 6px 13px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: #a9a2b8; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }
.atl-seg button.on { background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.14); color: var(--hi); }
.atl-toggles { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; }
.atl-tog { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink2); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
.atl-tog input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
.atl-tog i { position: relative; width: 30px; height: 17px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.12); transition: background .2s; }
.atl-tog i::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 2px; top: 2px; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink2); transition: transform .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1), background .2s; }
.atl-tog input:checked + i { background: rgba(79,224,255,.35); }
.atl-tog input:checked + i::after { transform: translateX(13px); background: #4fe0ff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #4fe0ff; }
.atl-tog input:focus-visible + i { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 2px; }
.atl-tour { padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--grad); border: 0; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: var(--shadow-grad); }
.atl-tour.on { background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.12); box-shadow: none; }

.atl-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px; gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
.atl-stage { position: relative; min-height: 420px; padding: 44px 8px 64px; border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; perspective: 1600px;
  background: radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 46%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--acc, #4fe0ff) 9%, var(--atl-floor)) 0%, var(--atl-floor) 62%), var(--atl-floor);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06), 0 40px 120px var(--atl-shadow2); transition: background .6s; }
.atl-stage::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: .5;
  background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(var(--line-rgb),.07) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 50%, #000 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 50%, #000 0%, transparent 100%); }
.atl-floor { position: absolute; left: 12%; right: 12%; bottom: 26px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(closest-side, color-mix(in srgb, var(--acc, #4fe0ff) 30%, transparent), transparent); filter: blur(18px); opacity: .55;
  animation: atlFloor 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
@keyframes atlFloor { from { transform: scaleX(.92); opacity: .45; } to { transform: scaleX(1.04); opacity: .65; } }
.atl-float { position: relative; transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(var(--rx, 0deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 0deg)); transition: transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
.atl-bob { will-change: transform; animation: atlBob 10s ease-in-out 1s infinite alternate; }
.atl-map { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; overflow: visible;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 26px 34px var(--atl-shadow)) drop-shadow(0 0 26px color-mix(in srgb, var(--acc, #4fe0ff) 22%, transparent)); }
.atl-map.nation { animation: atlMapIn .8s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.atl-map.flying { filter: none; }
.atl-map.flying .atl-c { transition: none; }
.atl-map.state { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; animation: atlDeep .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
@keyframes atlMapIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) scale(.97); } }
@keyframes atlDeep { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.06); filter: blur(8px); } }
@keyframes atlBob { from { transform: translateY(-5px); } to { transform: translateY(5px); } }
.atl-c { stroke: var(--atl-floor); stroke-width: .25; transition: fill .55s ease, opacity .5s ease; cursor: pointer; }
.atl-map.state .atl-c { stroke-width: .9; }
.atl-c:hover { opacity: .82; }
.atl-c.dim { opacity: .08; }
.atl-zoomg { transform-origin: 0 0; }
.atl-zoomg.flying .atl-c { stroke-width: .08; }
.atl-lines path { fill: none; stroke: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.55); stroke-width: .6; pointer-events: none; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
.atl-dots { pointer-events: auto; }
.atl-dot { fill: #8ff0ff; stroke: rgba(0,0,0,.5); stroke-width: .3; cursor: pointer; transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; animation: atlDot .5s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) both; }
.atl-dot.big { stroke-width: 1; }
.atl-dot:hover { fill: var(--hi); }
@keyframes atlDot { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0); } }
.atl-ring { fill: none; stroke: #4fe0ff; stroke-width: 1.4; opacity: 0; transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center; animation: atlRing 1.6s ease-out both; pointer-events: none; }
@keyframes atlRing { 0% { opacity: .9; transform: scale(.3); } 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(2.4); } }
.atl-halo { fill: none; stroke: var(--hi); stroke-width: 1.1; pointer-events: none; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(var(--hi-rgb),.7)); }
.atl-halo.st { stroke-width: 2.4; }

.atl-crumbs { position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 14px; z-index: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.atl-crumbs button { padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.04); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); cursor: pointer; }
.atl-crumbs button.on { color: var(--hi); border-color: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.22); }
.atl-crumbs em { font-style: normal; color: var(--mute2); }
.atl-tourbar { width: 90px; height: 3px; border-radius: 9px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.1); }
.atl-tourbar i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--grad); animation: atlTour 6.5s linear both; transform-origin: 0 50%; }
@keyframes atlTour { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }

.atl-legend { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 14px; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 2; display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 5px; width: min(420px, calc(100% - 32px)); text-align: center; }
.atl-ltitle { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink2); }
.atl-lrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11px; color: #a9a2b8; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.atl-lrow i { flex: 1; height: 7px; border-radius: 99px; box-shadow: 0 0 18px color-mix(in srgb, var(--acc, #4fe0ff) 35%, transparent); }
.atl-lnote { font-size: 11px; color: #6f6884; }

.atl-side { display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 18px; border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(var(--line-rgb),.05), rgba(var(--line-rgb),.015)); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); animation: atlDrill .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
@keyframes atlDrill { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(28px); } }
.atl-side h3 { margin: -4px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--hi); }
.atl-big b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: var(--hi); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.atl-big span { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-hist { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; height: 64px; padding-bottom: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.1); }
.atl-hist i { flex: 1; border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0; transform-origin: 50% 100%; animation: atlBar .6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
@keyframes atlBar { from { transform: scaleY(0); } }
.atl-hist u { position: absolute; top: -4px; bottom: -4px; width: 2px; margin-left: -1px; background: var(--hi); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(var(--hi-rgb),.6); transition: left .25s ease; }
.atl-sidenote { margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #a9a2b8; }
.atl-lh { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6884; }
.atl-list { display: grid; gap: 2px; }
.atl-li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8px minmax(0,1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 6px 8px; margin: 0 -8px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: var(--ink2); text-align: left; cursor: pointer; animation: atlRow .45s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.atl-li:hover { background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06); color: var(--hi); }
.atl-li i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; }
.atl-li b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.atl-li span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hi); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
@keyframes atlRow { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(14px); } }
.atl-focus { padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(var(--canvas-rgb),.45); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.1); animation: atlK .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both; }
.atl-fh { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
.atl-fh b { font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: 15px; color: var(--hi); }
.atl-fh span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-fgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 5px 10px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; }
.atl-fgrid span { color: var(--mute); }
.atl-fgrid b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink); text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.atl-races { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.atl-race { display: grid; gap: 1px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: left; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.04); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); color: var(--ink2); cursor: pointer; transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
.atl-race:hover { border-color: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.25); transform: translateY(-1px); }
.atl-race b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-race span { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hi); }
.atl-race em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
.atl-hc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-back { justify-self: start; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hi); background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.14); cursor: pointer; }
.atl-jump { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.atl-jchips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.atl-jchips button { width: 40px; padding: 6px 0; border-radius: 8px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink2); background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.04); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.09); cursor: pointer; transition: color .2s, border-color .2s, transform .2s; }
.atl-jchips button:hover { color: var(--hi); border-color: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.25); transform: translateY(-1px); }
.atl-jump select { width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 10px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.12); font-size: 13px; }
.atl-foot { margin: 0; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #6f6884; max-width: 110ch; }

.atl-loading { min-height: 360px; display: grid; place-items: center; align-content: center; gap: 14px; color: var(--mute); font-size: 13px; }
.atl-spin { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.1); border-top-color: #4fe0ff; animation: atlSpin .9s linear infinite; }
@keyframes atlSpin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

.atl-tip { position: fixed; z-index: 90; width: 260px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; pointer-events: none; font-family: var(--font-b); color: var(--ink2);
  background: rgba(var(--bg2-rgb),.96); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.14); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.4); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); animation: atlTip .16s ease-out; }
@keyframes atlTip { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } }
.atl-tn { font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--hi); }
.atl-ts { margin-top: 2px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.atl-tip.dc .atl-ts { color: #4fe0ff; margin: 0 0 3px; }
.atl-tv { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin: 9px 0 6px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); }
.atl-tv span { font-size: 12px; color: #a9a2b8; }
.atl-tv b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--hi); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.atl-tr { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
.atl-tr span { color: var(--mute); }
.atl-tr b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); text-align: right; }
.atl-tf { margin-top: 8px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute2); }

@media (max-width: 1080px) { .atl-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .atl-kpis { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); width: 100%; } }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .atl-stage { padding: 46px 0 78px; border-radius: 16px; min-height: 300px; }
  .atl-rail { flex-wrap: nowrap; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; }
  .atl-group { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .atl-chips { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
  .atl-kpi b { font-size: 21px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .atl, .atl *, .atl-tip { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
}

.fc-tip-odds { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px; margin-top: 9px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--fc-line-rgb),0.08); font-size: 12.5px; }
.fc-tip-odds span { width: 100%; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.4 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip-odds b { font-family: var(--font-m); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.fc-tip-kv { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 5px; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(var(--fc-ink-rgb),calc(0.55 * var(--fc-mute) + var(--fc-floor))); }
.fc-tip-kv:first-of-type { margin-top: 9px; }
.fc-tip-kv b { color: var(--hi); font-family: var(--font-m); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

.sp .sp-lede { margin: 0; max-width: 72ch; color: var(--mute); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }
.sp .sp-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
.sp .sp-kpi { display: grid; gap: 4px; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--glass); }
.sp .sp-kpi.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
.sp .sp-kpi span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-kpi b { font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.sp .sp-kpi em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-kpi2 { display: flex; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 10px; }
.sp .sp-kpi2 em { margin-right: 12px; }
.sp .sp-split { display: flex; width: 100%; border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); }
.sp .sp-split i { display: block; height: 100%; }
.sp .sp-focus { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px 28px; margin-top: 22px; }
.sp .sp-fh { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-fcol { display: grid; gap: 6px; align-content: start; }
.sp .sp-frow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(96px, 1.2fr) 2fr 52px 62px 62px; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 6px 4px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: none; color: var(--ink, var(--hi)); text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: 13.5px; }
.sp .sp-frow:hover, .sp .sp-frow:focus-visible { background: var(--glass2); outline: none; }
.sp .sp-frow b { font-weight: 600; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.sp .sp-ftrack { height: 8px; border-radius: 99px; background: rgba(var(--line-rgb),.08); overflow: hidden; }
.sp .sp-ftrack i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; }
.sp .sp-fv, .sp .sp-fa { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: right; }
.sp .sp-fa { color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-chip { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-note { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-groups { margin-top: 18px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; }
.sp .sp-groups .sp-note b { font-weight: 700; }
.sp .sp-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 22px; }
.sp .sp-tools .seg { margin-left: 0; }
.sp .sp-tablewrap { margin-top: 10px; overflow-x: auto; }
.sp .sp-table { width: 100%; min-width: 860px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
.sp .sp-table th { padding: 8px 10px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); white-space: nowrap; }
.sp .sp-table td { padding: 9px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--line-rgb),.06); vertical-align: middle; }
.sp .sp-table .num { text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-m); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
.sp .sp-table td.name b { display: block; font-weight: 600; }
.sp .sp-table td.name span { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-table td.bar { min-width: 150px; }
.sp .sp-table .sp-bl { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-table tr.clickable { cursor: pointer; }
.sp .sp-table tr.clickable:hover td, .sp .sp-table tr.clickable:focus-visible td { background: var(--glass2); }
.sp .sp-table tr.clickable:focus-visible { outline: none; }
.sp .sp-sig { display: inline-block; font-style: normal; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 8px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 99px; white-space: nowrap; }
.sp .sp-foot { margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--mute); max-width: 110ch; }
.sp .fc-more { margin-top: 12px; }
.sp .sp-race { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
.sp .sp-rside { display: grid; gap: 4px; align-content: start; }
.sp .sp-rbig { font-family: var(--font-d); font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.sp .sp-rside > em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-rside dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }
.sp .sp-rside dt { color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-rside dd { margin: 0; text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 12.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.sp .sp-top { display: grid; gap: 4px; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12.5px; }
.sp .sp-top > span { font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); }
.sp .sp-top div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
.sp .sp-top b { font-weight: 600; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.sp .sp-top em { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--font-m); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.sp .sp-ads { margin-top: 18px; max-width: 560px; }
.sp .sp-rfoot { margin-top: 18px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.sp .sp-rfoot p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mute); line-height: 1.5; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .sp .sp-focus, .sp .sp-race { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .sp .sp-kpi.wide { grid-column: auto; }
  .sp .sp-frow { grid-template-columns: minmax(80px, 1fr) 1.4fr 46px 56px; }
  .sp .sp-frow .sp-chip { display: none; }
  .sp .sp-frow b { white-space: normal; line-height: 1.25; }
}
</style><header class="fc-deskhead" id="desk"><div class="eye g">The race desk</div><h2>The 2026 <em>forecast</em></h2><div class="pmeta"><span>Every race, its map, its polls and its counties</span><a class="btn sm" href="/forecast/legislatures">State legislatures</a><a class="btn sm" href="/forecast/measures">Ballot measures</a><a class="btn sm" href="/forecast/methodology">Methodology</a><a class="btn sm" href="/forecast/changelog">Changelog</a></div></header><div class="card"><div class="empty">Loading the forecast</div></div></div><div class="opp fc-page fc-wide"><section class="fx" aria-labelledby="fx-h"><div class="eye g">The forecast in brief</div><h2 id="fx-h">Every 2026 forecast, <em>in one index</em></h2><p class="fx-lede">Democrats win the Senate in 79% of simulations, with 53 seats on average<!-- -->. <!-- -->Democrats win the House in 91%, with 243 seats on average<!-- -->. Democrats average <!-- -->28<!-- --> of 50 governorships after the election, are favored to control <!-- -->44<!-- --> of the <!-- -->87<!-- --> state legislative chambers on the ballot, and <!-- -->120<!-- --> of <!-- -->146<!-- --> statewide ballot measures are favored to pass. Every number comes from <!-- -->2,000<!-- --> simulated elections, updated <!-- -->October 21, 2026<!-- -->, <!-- -->13<!-- --> days before the November 3 election.</p><div class="fx-grid"><div class="card"><div class="card-h"><h3>Senate races</h3><span class="eye" style="margin-left:auto">Leader · chance to win</span></div><ul class="fx-list"><li><a href="/forecast/al/senate">Alabama Senate</a><span class="fx-who r">Moore</span><b class="mono fx-p r">&gt;99%</b></li><li><a href="/forecast/ak/senate">Alaska Senate</a><span class="fx-who d">Peltola</span><b class="mono fx-p d">60%</b></li><li><a href="/forecast/ar/senate">Arkansas Senate</a><span class="fx-who r">Cotton</span><b class="mono fx-p r">98%</b></li><li><a href="/forecast/co/senate">Colorado Senate</a><span class="fx-who d">Hickenlooper</span><b cl